 "markdown": {
  "url": "/dpf/@omnibus/return-proposal-dpf-threshold",
  "body": "This is the return proposal for the Decentralized Pixa Fund.\n\nIt pays to **pixa.omnibus**, the treasury itself, so every PXS it \"wins\" stays in the fund. The DPF pays proposals in order of votes. Anything ranked below this proposal gets nothing, because the return proposal uses up the daily budget first.\n\nIn practice: **a proposal is funded only if it has more votes than this one.** Vote for it if you want a threshold that other proposals must beat. Leave it unvoted and the threshold is zero, so any proposal with votes gets paid.\n\nIt runs until 24 September 2036. Its creation fee goes into the treasury.",
